cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this app or tutorial, please cite it as below."
title: "The Earth as a Neural Field"
abstract: >-
  The elevation model of the whole Earth (ETOPO 2022), stored in the weights
  of a small neural network: a Streamlit app to train and inspect the network,
  and a step-by-step tutorial in German and English on storing geodata in
  neural networks (implicit neural representations).
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
